# Lithos — copy to .env.local for local work; in production set these in Vercel > Project > Settings.
# Never commit real values. Only BUFFER_API_KEY is secret; the Supabase URL and the publishable
# (anon) key are embedded in index.html on purpose (RLS protects the data, not key secrecy).
BUFFER_API_KEY=
# Server-side owner allowlist for POST /api/buffer-sync (comma-separated emails). Empty = every
# caller gets 403, so set it before the first sync. Not secret, but keep it out of the client.
LITHOS_OWNER_EMAILS=
